{"ID":"20250224124004-x2dy8ce","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250224124004-x2dy8ce","title":"A4L1——数组","type":"doc","updated":"20250224124310"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224124004-jhz9u8p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124004-jhz9u8p","updated":"20250224124034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"u","TextMarkTextContent":"数组（array）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是一种线性数据结构，其将相同类型的元素存储在连续的内存空间中。我们将元素在数组中的位置称为该元素的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"u","TextMarkTextContent":"索引（index）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20250224124039-6219z4r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124039-6219z4r","updated":"20250224124039"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"style":"width: 603px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240910005111-sk378xl.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 603px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250224124209-w2lpbf8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250224124209-w2lpbf8","updated":"20250224124301"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"数组的优点与局限性"}]},{"ID":"20250224124225-aa2xqjo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124225-aa2xqjo","updated":"20250224124225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"数组存储在连续的内存空间内，且元素类型相同。这种做法包含丰富的先验信息，系统可以利用这些信息来优化数据结构的操作效率。"}]},{"ID":"20250224124225-t63e4hm","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250224124225-t63e4hm","updated":"20250224124225"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224124225-pnf2nv8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224124225-pnf2nv8","updated":"20250224124225"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224124225-34pynha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124225-34pynha","updated":"20250224124225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"空间效率高"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：数组为数据分配了连续的内存块，无须额外的结构开销。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250224124225-n34bnz0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224124225-n34bnz0","updated":"20250224124225"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224124225-cprwez8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124225-cprwez8","updated":"20250224124225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"支持随机访问"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：数组允许在 O(1) 时间内访问任何元素。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250224124225-d5vt7gp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224124225-d5vt7gp","updated":"20250224124225"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224124225-6l1eotk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124225-6l1eotk","updated":"20250224124225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"缓存局部性"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：当访问数组元素时，计算机不仅会加载它，还会缓存其周围的其他数据，从而借助高速缓存来提升后续操作的执行速度。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250224124225-cs8mjjb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124225-cs8mjjb","updated":"20250224124225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"连续空间存储是一把双刃剑，其存在以下局限性。"}]},{"ID":"20250224124225-muforbu","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250224124225-muforbu","updated":"20250224124225"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224124225-ua1f4jv","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224124225-ua1f4jv","updated":"20250224124225"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224124225-2uvd6bk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124225-2uvd6bk","updated":"20250224124225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"插入与删除效率低"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：当数组中元素较多时，插入与删除操作需要移动大量的元素。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250224124225-srm9wnk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224124225-srm9wnk","updated":"20250224124225"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224124225-zpjsy2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124225-zpjsy2d","updated":"20250224124225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"长度不可变"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：数组在初始化后长度就固定了，扩容数组需要将所有数据复制到新数组，开销很大。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250224124225-8itiw94","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224124225-8itiw94","updated":"20250224124225"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224124225-o7o0nvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124225-o7o0nvr","updated":"20250224124225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"空间浪费"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：如果数组分配的大小超过实际所需，那么多余的空间就被浪费了。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250224124301-cwmp2ni","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250224124301-cwmp2ni","updated":"20250224124310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"数组典型应用"}]},{"ID":"20250224124310-owly2j7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124310-owly2j7","updated":"20250224124310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"数组是一种基础且常见的数据结构，既频繁应用在各类算法之中，也可用于实现各种复杂数据结构。"}]},{"ID":"20250224124310-5hvvoeh","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250224124310-5hvvoeh","updated":"20250224124310"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224124310-dpv9aob","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224124310-dpv9aob","updated":"20250224124310"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224124310-ebk11h9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124310-ebk11h9","updated":"20250224124310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"随机访问"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：如果我们想随机抽取一些样本，那么可以用数组存储，并生成一个随机序列，根据索引实现随机抽样。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250224124310-hh88sg9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224124310-hh88sg9","updated":"20250224124310"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224124310-z86ib7f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124310-z86ib7f","updated":"20250224124310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"排序和搜索"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：数组是排序和搜索算法最常用的数据结构。快速排序、归并排序、二分查找等都主要在数组上进行。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250224124310-0mj5sts","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224124310-0mj5sts","updated":"20250224124310"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224124310-fuo4iph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124310-fuo4iph","updated":"20250224124310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"查找表"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：当需要快速查找一个元素或其对应关系时，可以使用数组作为查找表。假如我们想实现字符到 ASCII 码的映射，则可以将字符的 ASCII 码值作为索引，对应的元素存放在数组中的对应位置。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250224124310-eb5azgm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224124310-eb5azgm","updated":"20250224124310"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224124310-r0xz0t1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124310-r0xz0t1","updated":"20250224124310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"机器学习"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：神经网络中大量使用了向量、矩阵、张量之间的线性代数运算，这些数据都是以数组的形式构建的。数组是神经网络编程中最常使用的数据结构。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250224124310-7lzvh7s","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224124310-7lzvh7s","updated":"20250224124310"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224124310-ryu0n0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224124310-ryu0n0w","updated":"20250224124310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"数据结构实现"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：数组可以用于实现栈、队列、哈希表、堆、图等数据结构。例如，图的邻接矩阵表示实际上是一个二维数组。"}]}]}]}]}